        "content": "<p>I have</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>import VersoBlog</p>\n<p>open Verso.Genre Blog</p>\n<p>#doc (Post) \"MWE: prose rendered twice\" =&gt;</p>\n<p>This paragraph appears once, before the code block.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kd\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hello</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">42</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>This paragraph appears once, after the code block.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>but this renders as</p>\n<p><img alt=\"image.png\" class=\"inline-image\" data-original-content-type=\"image/png\" data-original-dimensions=\"1328x976\" data-original-src=\"/user_uploads/3121/33E_NnEvo_hXAJ7czhZAhzU_/image.png\" src=\"/user_uploads/thumbnail/3121/33E_NnEvo_hXAJ7czhZAhzU_/image.png/840x560.webp\"></p>\n<p>What should I have written?</p>\n<p>Full repo based on the example <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/verso-templates/tree/main/basic-blog\">https://github.com/leanprover/verso-templates/tree/main/basic-blog</a> is at <a href=\"https://github.com/idontgetoutmuch/mercator-connection\">https://github.com/idontgetoutmuch/mercator-connection</a></p>\n<p>Many thanks</p>",
